# ---- Personal notes / working docs ---------------------------------------
# A local folder of guides, drafts and staging that is deliberately NOT part of
# the submission. Keeps the public repo clean; nothing here is ever uploaded.
# Instructions for every other folder live in _notes/REPO-SETUP.md.
_notes/

# ---- KiCad ---------------------------------------------------------------
# User-specific project state (window layout, last-used paths, per-user prefs).
# Not part of the design; regenerated automatically.
*.kicad_prl

# KiCad's own local-history store. THIS IS ITSELF A GIT REPO (it uses git to
# snapshot your files every few minutes) and it is ~9 MB of duplicates.
# Never commit it: a nested repo inside your repo breaks the checker and bloats
# the clone. See docs/REPO-SETUP.md.
.history/

# Auto-backups KiCad writes next to the project on every save.
*.bak-*
*-backups/
fp-info-cache

# Open-file lock files (these appear as ~Starbiew.kicad_sch.lck).
~*.lck
*.lck

# ---- Build output --------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerate from source; never commit compiled binaries.
build/
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.uf2
*.map
.pio/

# ---- Gerbers: deliberately NOT ignored -----------------------------------
# gerbers/*.g* and the drill files ARE committed on purpose - the submission
# spec lists them as a recommended deliverable. Do not add them here.

# ---- OS / editor --------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
